计算,调整后的交易日按调整后的转股价格和收盘价计算。","PARTY_NAME":"联合资信评估股份有限公司","CONVERT_STOCK_PRICE":62.3,"TRANSFER_PRICE":null,"TRANSFER_VALUE":null,"CURRENT_BOND_PRICE":null,"TRANSFER_PREMIUM_RATIO":null,"CONVERT_STOCK_PRICEHQ":null,"MARKET":null,"RESALE_TRIG_PRICE":null,"REDEEM_TRIG_PRICE":null,"PBV_RATIO":null,"IB_START_DATE":"2026-01-26 00:00:00","IB_END_DATE":"2027-01-25 00:00:00","CASHFLOW_DATE":"2027-01-26 00:00:00","COUPON_IR":2,"PARAM_NAME":"交易所系统网上向社会公众投资者发行,交易所系统网上向原A股无限售股东优先配售,交易所系统网下向原A股有限售股东优先配售","ISSUE_TYPE":"1,4,5","EXECUTE_REASON_SH":"4","PAYDAYNEW":"-26","CURRENT_BOND_PRICENEW":null,"IS_CONVERT_STOCK":"否","IS_REDEEM":"是","IS_SELLBACK":"是","FIRST_PROFIT":267.705428543527,"PUBLIC_START_DATE_HOURS":"2021-01-26 15:00:00"},{"SECURITY_CODE":"123096","SECUCODE":"123096.SZ","TRADE_MARKET":"CNSESZ","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"思创转债","DELIST_DATE":"2024-12-02 00:00:00","LISTING_DATE":"2021-03-01 00:00:00","CONVERT_STOCK_CODE":"300078","BOND_EXPIRE":"3.8247","RATING":"BB","VALUE_DATE":"2021-01-26 00:00:00","ISSUE_YEAR":"2021","CEASE_DATE":"2024-11-21 00:00:00","EXPIRE_DATE":"2024-11-22 00:00:00","PAY_INTEREST_DAY":"01-26","INTEREST_RATE_EXPLAIN":"第一年0.40%、第二年0.60%、第三年1.00%、第四年1.50%、第五年2.50%、第六年3.00%。","BOND_COMBINE_CODE":"21270600001FXT","ACTUAL_ISSUE_SCALE":8.17,"ISSUE_PRICE":100,"REMARK":"本次发行的可转债向发行人在股权登记日(2021年1月25日,T-1日)收市后中国结算深圳分公司登记在册的原股东优先配售,原股东优先配售后余额部分(含原股东放弃优先配售部分)采用通过深圳证券交易所交易系统网上定价发行的方式进行。","PAR_VALUE":100,"ISSUE_OBJECT":"(1)向发行人原股东优先配售:发行公告公布的股权登记日(2021年1月25日,T-1日)收市后登记在册的发行人所有股东。(2)网上发行:中华人民共和国境内持有深交所证券账户的社会公众投资者,包括:自然人、法人、证券投资基金等(法律法规禁止购买者除外)。(3)本次发行的主承销商的自营账户不得参与网上申购。","REDEEM_TYPE":"2","EXECUTE_REASON_HS":null,"NOTICE_DATE_HS":null,"NOTICE_DATE_SH":"2024-11-01 00:00:00","EXECUTE_PRICE_HS":null,"EXECUTE_PRICE_SH":101.24,"RECORD_DATE_SH":"2024-11-21 00:00:00","EXECUTE_START_DATESH":"2024-11-22 00:00:00","EXECUTE_START_DATEHS":null,"EXECUTE_END_DATE":null,"CORRECODE":"370078","CORRECODE_NAME_ABBR":"思创发债","PUBLIC_START_DATE":"2021-01-26 00:00:00","CORRECODEO":"380078","CORR