前的交易日按调整前的转股价格和收盘价计算,调整后的交易日按调整后的转股价格和收盘价计算。","PARTY_NAME":"联合信用评级有限公司","CONVERT_STOCK_PRICE":6.64,"TRANSFER_PRICE":null,"TRANSFER_VALUE":null,"CURRENT_BOND_PRICE":null,"TRANSFER_PREMIUM_RATIO":null,"CONVERT_STOCK_PRICEHQ":null,"MARKET":null,"RESALE_TRIG_PRICE":null,"REDEEM_TRIG_PRICE":null,"PBV_RATIO":null,"IB_START_DATE":null,"IB_END_DATE":null,"CASHFLOW_DATE":null,"COUPON_IR":null,"PARAM_NAME":"交易所系统网上向社会公众投资者发行,交易所系统网上向原A股无限售股东优先配售,交易所系统网下向机构投资者协议发行","ISSUE_TYPE":"1,2,4","EXECUTE_REASON_SH":"5","PAYDAYNEW":"-12","CURRENT_BOND_PRICENEW":null,"IS_CONVERT_STOCK":"否","IS_REDEEM":"是","IS_SELLBACK":"是","FIRST_PROFIT":301.690351111041,"PUBLIC_START_DATE_HOURS":"2015-06-12 15:00:00"},{"SECURITY_CODE":"113008","SECUCODE":"113008.SH","TRADE_MARKET":"CNSESH","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"电气转债","DELIST_DATE":"2021-02-02 00:00:00","LISTING_DATE":"2015-02-16 00:00:00","CONVERT_STOCK_CODE":"601727","BOND_EXPIRE":"6","RATING":"AAA","VALUE_DATE":"2015-02-02 00:00:00","ISSUE_YEAR":"2015","CEASE_DATE":"2021-02-01 00:00:00","EXPIRE_DATE":"2021-02-02 00:00:00","PAY_INTEREST_DAY":"02-02","INTEREST_RATE_EXPLAIN":"第一年为0.2%、第二年为0.5%、第三年为1.0%、第四年为1.5%、第五年为1.5%、第六年为1.6%。","BOND_COMBINE_CODE":"15270600001SIB","ACTUAL_ISSUE_SCALE":60,"ISSUE_PRICE":100,"REMARK":null,"PAR_VALUE":100,"ISSUE_OBJECT":"(1)向发行人除控股股东上海电气(集团)总公司以外的原A股股东优先配售:\n发行公告公布的股权登记日(即2015年1月30日,T-1日)收市后登记在册的发行人A股\n股东。 \n(2)网下发行:根据《中华人民共和国证券投资基金法》批准设立的证券投资基\n金和法律法规允许申购的法人,以及符合法律法规规定的其它机构投资者。 \n(3)网上发行:中华人民共和国境内持有上交所证券账户的自然人、法人、证券投资基金等(法律法规禁止购买者除外)。","REDEEM_TYPE":"2","EXECUTE_REASON_HS":null,"NOTICE_DATE_HS":null,"NOTICE_DATE_SH":"2021-01-27 00:00:00","EXECUTE_PRICE_HS":null,"EXECUTE_PRICE_SH":106.6,"RECORD_DATE_SH":"2021-02-01 00:00:00","EXECUTE_START_DATESH":"2021-02-02 00:00:00","EXECUTE_START_DATEHS":null,"EXECUTE_END_DATE":null,"CORRECODE":"783727","CORRECODE_NAME_ABBR":"电气发债","PUBLIC_START_DATE":"2015-02-02 00:00:00","CORRECODEO":"764727","CORRECODE_NAME_ABBRO":"电气配债","BOND_START_DATE":"2015-02-06 00:00:00","SECURITY_START_DATE":